  "prefLabel": "Jus 602.01 Administrative claim",
  "priorExpiration": "2017-09-25",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Jus 602.01 “Administrative claim” means a claim application that the unit has reviewed and determined to be complete and for which eligibility appears to be clear, irrespective of the amount of the claim or severity of the eligible crime.\n\nSource. #4864, eff 7-13-90; ss by #6052, eff 7-1-95, EXPIRED: 7-1-03\n\nNew. #9553, eff 9-25-09, EXPIRED: 9-25-17\n\nNew. #12938, eff 12-9-19",
